# Kena: Bridge of Spirits (PPSA01802), Linux/AMD: linux-reach-level-load.pad, continued past the
# first level load to the first gameplay prompt ("Press ... to Pulse") and one Pulse (L1).
#
# Anchors are SECONDS from the first pad poll, held for 1 s each. The first 590 s are
# linux-reach-level-load.pad's: New Game, difficulty, brightness, then a Cross every 25 s through
# the intro narration and the opening cutscene. On an unloaded box the Pulse prompt is on screen
# from about 590 s (pad flip ~1600) and holds until Pulse is pressed.
#
#   650 s  L1 (Pulse) at the prompt, then nothing: the post-Pulse oracle on #3781/#3787 is the cave
#          about 5 s later, once the camera's short pan settles.
#   720 s  L1 again, for a run whose load was slower and reached the prompt late.
#
# Measured 2026-10-08 on Linux/RADV, prosper-app in a visible window, main 04a07cbe7
# (PROSPER_NULL_PAGE=1, PROSPER_GUEST_ARGS= empty, fresh save roots).
